<p class="eyebrow">Fortress revival &middot; foundations corrections &middot; version 16, 2 November 2026</p>
<h1>Drafted corrections of POSITIONS, for your yes or no</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Part 1 holds the corrections of POSITIONS drafted on 30 October, one section per entry: ten new texts, two questions on P-42, and one entry that needs no change. Each new text shows the added words underlined and the removed words struck through, with the current text collapsed under it. Its texts are applied in the record since 31 October.</p>
<p class="standfirst">Part 2 holds the three questions for climb batch 22c, which you answered on 29 October, each collapsed with your answer under its question. Part 3 holds the 16 corrections of POSITIONS that landed at your yes on 29 October, each collapsed. Part 4 lists the 6 entries that stayed as they were then. Part 5 holds the three entries that your answer of 2 November on the team's later word changed, each with its changes marked in place, as in part 1. P-26 and P-7 also hold their rewording, which you accepted and which is applied.</p>
<p class="standfirst">Times are UTC, with your time beside them. References sit at the end of each section and each part.</p>
</header>

